        <mxCell id="K9I6vbQ4g4FevOCkwQSP-66" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Green node : Node with LLM call&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Red node : Node with no&amp;nbsp; LLM calls&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Extraction agent : Extract entities/relationships from given text chunk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Validation agent : Validate if extracted entities/relationships are representatively for the given text chunk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;KG extraction orchestrator : Process and save intermediate data(subgraph of each chunk), Collect and pass next chunk to be processed, Check if all chunks are processed; if yes end process, otherwise continue with next chunk&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
